e/workflows/review.md\n- Skill:     pose-review\n- Rules:     .pose/rules/security.md, .pose/rules/documentation-style.md, .pose/rules/backend-go.md\n- Spec:      false\n- ADR:       false\n- Knowledge: consume=true, produce=handoff (quando aceitar risco residual ou condicionar merge)\n- Validation: exigir evidência de pose validate do implementador\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"The new memo is limited to the operation, but its concurrent-miss path allows multiple computations for the same key. I’m checking that against the “at most once” requirements and reviewing whether cached results preserve read limits, loss reporting, and caller isolation. I’ll inspect the sealed test evidence without building or writing in this sandbox."}}
